  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside orchard garden in mountain, the green giant’s moss-like color turns dark red as if fire were burning inside it, then the four Hei tribe elders activate this dual immortal killer move. An intense explosion follows, and a dark red translucent shock wave bursts from the giant’s body. Vines entangled on its legs burn like paper and become ash. Three shock waves sweep obstacles away, raising dust and dropping rocks, and the aura makes Fairy Li Shan take a small step back.",
      "chapters": [
        942
      ],
