      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After several uses, most of the pear trees in the valley are burned to ashes, though they continue to grow from the ground toward the green giant. When Hei Cheng is taken, countless dark ember casts follow consecutively as the elders try to break the cage, just before Nine Dragon Body Protection appears as dragon marks on the giant’s chest and back.",
